<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-gallus-gallus-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Gallus gallus Holocene Turing pigment-ocellus wavelength, 319.2 µm (pass 1) — Code-to-model traceability: 80/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "gamma_for_wavelength and critical_wavelength_um are the onset formula. Lean theorems pin the onset gap, the singleton chronoseries, and the six-wavelength patch. The radial renderer is a weakly nonlinear reduction, not a line-by-line transcription of Prum & Williamson's growing-feather geometry." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-gallus-gallus-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-gallus-gallus-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-gallus-gallus-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Gallus gallus Holocene Turing pigment-ocellus wavelength, 319.2 µm (pass 1) — Model fidelity to source: 76/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The onset formula k_c^2 = (Dv fu + Du gv) / (2 Du Dv) is implemented and γ is solved so λ_c is 319.2 µm. Pass 1 does not integrate the PDE, so the selected wavelength is analytical rather than emergent from a time-stepper." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-gallus-gallus-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-gallus-gallus-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 7.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

